      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "可移除倒计时沉浸叙事，也可用Hardcore挑战历史压迫者",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Whether you seek a brutal test against history's oppressors or a thoughtful journey of justice, Hell Clock adapts to your path. Remove all time pressure with Relaxed Mode, or push your limits in Hardcore mode.",
